# Wholeloop invocation

Read the actual installed SKILL.md and locate its sibling scripts/wl.mjs. Ask that
launcher for adapter root before resolving packaged resources; never infer a core
from PATH. Retain explicit human decisions, external runtime state and observed
evidence. Native installation and a version token do not prove model execution.
